  4.644668 - 1764.4983/(T + -33.2244), in-sample R2 0.999980 over 26
  points, 346.03-413.67 K. HELD OUT: 14 points, AAD 5.6372 % (max 12.1202
  %) against the band 0.36 % -> notValidated; the stage-1 least-squares
  answer on the same points: AAD 4.7526 %, max 10.3021 %. Its own normal
