  3.9934 %; AmbroseWalton on the same points: mean 4.5289 %, max 8.2943
  %. Outliers discarded: none. Its own normal boiling point (101.325
  kPa): 413.68 K. PROMOTED on 2026-11-10 into
  data/standards/components/diNButylEther.dat as reviewStatus
  autoPromoted, humanReviewed false, because: under the DEFAULT
  acceptance of DEV.md 4c C283 (no system/curationDict), 4 studies, 57
  points kept, 0 discarded as outliers; max relative error 3.993 % (mean
  1.458 %) against 5 %; Tb inside the kept points' range, normal boiling
  point 413.68 K, -1.67 K from the record's Tb 415.35 K (reported, not a
  condition); AmbroseWalton on the same points mean 4.529 % / max 8.294 %
  @@EARLIER-END@@

  NO MEASURED POINT IS IN THIS TREE: constant/archiveDatasets declares every
  series by DOI, NIST URL and sha256; `bin/choupo-curate fetch` regenerates
